title Cassette LOAD from the blank cassette, frame 1 of 5 (0 ms): the load has just started: the blank cassette (no name) is still in its place; same 900 ms swap as between two named cassettes
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO deckempty
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 1
env CASSETTE_ANIM_FPS 60
env CASSETTE_LOAD_STEP_MS 0
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
key up
wait 200
key l
wait 600
shot blank-load-t000ms
expect notext "Take 007"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
